---
import { withBase } from "../../config/site"
---

<section id="acp" class="marketing-dark acp-section scroll-mt-20 border-b border-line">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-24 sm:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="reveal text-balance text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
        Simple by design. Flexible by default.
      </h2>
      <p class="reveal mt-5 max-w-2xl text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft [--reveal-delay:60ms]">
        Start with an agent. Add a Sandbox when it needs an execution environment, and a Workspace when its files
        need to survive the run. Configure each through its own provider.
      </p>
    </div>

    <dl class="reveal mt-10 grid gap-7 border-t border-line pt-7 [--reveal-delay:120ms] md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-10">
      <div>
        <dt class="font-mono text-[15px] font-medium text-agent">&lt;Agent /&gt;</dt>
        <dd class="mt-3 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Runs a coding agent with the prompt and tools you provide. Nest agents to pass results between them.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="font-mono text-[15px] font-medium text-signal">&lt;Sandbox /&gt;</dt>
        <dd class="mt-3 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Provides a place to run commands, from a local process to a container or remote environment.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="font-mono text-[15px] font-medium text-ok">&lt;Workspace /&gt;</dt>
        <dd class="mt-3 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Keeps files between runs. Choose a storage provider and when changes should be saved.
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>

    <figure class="acp-map-shell reveal mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-line p-3 [--reveal-delay:180ms] sm:p-6">
      <figcaption class="px-2 pt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft sm:px-3">
        AML runs the workflow and manages resource cleanup. Built-in coding agents connect through{" "}
        <a href="https://agentclientprotocol.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-ink underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-ink">Agent Client Protocol</a>.
      </figcaption>
      <svg id="acp-runtime-map" class="block w-full" aria-hidden="true" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"></svg>
      <ol class="sr-only">
        <li>Your app sends the authored JSX tree to the AML Runtime.</li>
        <li>The runtime evaluates Agents using their selected providers.</li>
        <li>Built-in coding-agent providers use the shared ACP engine to run agent sessions.</li>
        <li>When a Sandbox is configured, the agent process runs in that execution environment.</li>
        <li>When a Workspace is configured, its files are loaded and saved according to its save policy.</li>
      </ol>
    </figure>

    <div class="reveal mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-[14px] [--reveal-delay:180ms]">
      <a href={withBase("docs/concepts/")} class="text-ink underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-ink">
        How these components fit together
      </a>
      <a href={withBase("docs/compatibility/")} class="text-ink-soft underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-ink">
        Provider compatibility
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
